# Keep the repository's own line endings stable across Windows and Linux.
* text=auto

# Model artifacts are hashed byte for byte (ml/artifacts/MANIFEST.json), so git
# must never touch their line endings. Without this, checking out on Windows
# rewrote focused_reference_means.json from LF to CRLF, and the hash check
# failed on a file nobody had edited.
#
# This block must stay BELOW the rule above: in .gitattributes the last
# matching rule wins.
ml/artifacts/** -text
